Products Recommendation               AOTC 5V导头电磁阀 1W low-power coil for lower heat generation and reduced power consumption, supporting long-time energization; 
Fast response as quick as 8 ms, with sensitive switching performance for high-speed control applications; 
Designed for manifold integration and centralized control, enabling organized piping with unified air supply and exhaust; 
Aluminum alloy valve body with high-precision iron core and wear-resistant sealing structure, reducing internal friction and enhancing long-term operating stability.               AOTC TZV系列低功率电磁阀 1W low-power coil for lower power consumption and reduced heat generation;
Response time as fast as 8 ms, ideal for high-cycle applications;
Up to 70% more compact, with manifold integration to save installation space;
Plug-in wiring and LED indicators for easier installation and maintenance.

product_recommendation_description:
1W low-power coil for lower heat generation and reduced power consumption, supporting long-time energization; 
Fast response as quick as 8 ms, with sensitive switching performance for high-speed control applications; 
Designed for manifold integration and centralized control, enabling organized piping with unified air supply and exhaust; 
