Products_Recommendation:
Products Recommendation               2" CNC Intelligent Ultra-Thin Hose Crimping Machine The 2" CNC Intelligent Ultra-Thin Hose Crimping Machine (Model KWT145) is developed by Hebei Kaiwentuo Hydraulic Machinery Co., Ltd. It features an integrated forged crimp head and an ultra-thin body design, offering a compact footprint that saves space, and is suitable for precision crimping of high-pressure hydraulic hose assemblies.

Main features:

1. CNC intelligent control: touch screen + PLC precision control with high crimping accuracy, multiple parameter presets for one-touch recall;
2. Ultra-thin body design: small footprint, ideal for compact workshops and repair shops;
3. Two-speed cylinder: fast idle stroke (≥10mm/s) and stable crimping speed of 0.5–2mm/s;
4. Three operation modes: manual / semi-automatic / fully automatic;
5. Quick die change with dovetail dies;
6. ISO 9001 certified.

Technical parameters:

- Model: KWT145
- Crimping range: 6–51mm (1/4"–2")
- Max crimping force: 300T
- System pressure: 30–35MPa
- Motor power: 4kW
- Oil tank capacity: 45L
- Machine weight               3” KWT165 Hydraulic Hose Crimping Machine KWT165 hydraulic hose crimping machine: manual/semi-auto/full-auto modes, 7" touch screen with 200 presets, 360T crimping force, 210mm max opening, 1/4"–3" (4SP industrial) crimping range, 4kW motor, one-second quick die change. Ideal for mass hose production and OEM assembly workshops.                 KWT190 Hydraulic Hose Crimping Machine KWT190 hydraulic hose crimping machine: manual/semi-auto/full-auto modes, 7" touch screen with 200 presets, 360T crimping force, 210mm max opening, 1/4"–3" (4SP industrial) crimping range, 4kW motor, one-second quick die change. Ideal for mass hose production and OEM assembly workshops.               10" KWT800 Hydraulic Hose Crimping Machine KWT800 large-opening hydraulic hose crimping machine: 570mm max opening, 800T crimping force, 2"–12" crimping range, 7.5kW motor, 10" touch screen with 200 presets, servo drive, manual/semi-auto/full-auto modes. Ideal for steel-wire PE composite pipes, large-diameter high-pressure hose assemblies and oil drilling pipelines.

